Upload commit 4d25a24 introduced accidental byte-identical copies via
drag-drop collisions (' 2' suffixes) and space-named variants alongside
underscore-named files. Removes 15 duplicates; every removed file has a
byte-identical survivor (verified). No unique content is lost.

Kept canonical copies:
- EAFIX_SSOT_REGISTRY_SYSTEM_FINAL_MERGED_IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN_v2_0_0.json
  (matches verification spec target_plan.filename; hash binding intact)
- underscore-named forms of the decision/ingestion/skeleton artifacts

This completes the FND-02 duplicate-collapse for MASTER-V2 and clears the
new collisions before PHASE-00 re-baselining.

Refs: FND-02, PHASE-02 (GOV-020) of EAFIX-GOVERNANCE-DEFECT-REMEDIATION-001
